sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Controller
    participant M as Model
    participant R as Radio loop
    R->>C: PDR zero everywhere, noise floor high everywhere
    C->>M: observation
    M-->>C: run spectrum_scan three times
    C->>R: spectrum_scan over 6 s
    R-->>C: all 8 channels above threshold, persistently
    C->>R: neighbor_probe on 3 channels
    R-->>C: no peer heard, noise high on each
    C->>R: check LoRa fallback band
    R-->>C: also jammed, no reachable peer
    C->>C: refusal criteria met, force declare_link_lost
    C->>R: execute return-to-home on last known position
    Note over C,R: bounded steps, no infinite hopping
